    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nFade out: Brian",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "★Request\nFade in: Brian\r\nCostume: Casual clothes",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Without frustration or irritation... I simply\r\nwaited for her to appear, wondering when she would arrive.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Walking down night roads alone is certainly dangerous,\r\nbut I couldn't imagine her ever worrying about something like that.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...You never get tired of striking up\r\nconversations with me, do you?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...It's getting dark out.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I'm eating at the cafeteria.\r\nSee ya.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Narita Brian was standing there.\r\nShe curtly brushed off the young guy talking to her and looked my way.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I thanked her for waiting.\r\nWithout a word, Narita Brian turned and headed back to the dorms.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...\r\n...Beat it.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "(...Worry, huh? Who knows.\r\nI'd like to ask that myself.)",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "*sigh* ...It's a pain, but the student council asked me to run an errand.\r\nI'm on my way to the shopping mall.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Undeterred by the crowd,\r\nNarita Brian stepped right into the store.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...A wave of nostalgia washes over me.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Maybe so. But whenever I talk to her,\r\nshe always listens. And that is—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "However, right there—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "It seems we're still a long way from having a proper back-and-forth conversation.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Narita Brian briskly walked away,\r\nleaving me behind...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...I suppose.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "It turns out we have the same destination. But just as I told her and was about to ask if we should go together—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...I guess so.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "We're heading back.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...You're a strange one.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...I don't give you much of a reaction.\r\nMost people would get sick of it.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Just walk. I'll leave you behind.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Hurry up.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Let's go.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Yeah.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I thought we had begun to build some trust, but maybe she really doesn't want anything to do with me outside of running—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I naturally assumed\r\nshe was out searching for me.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...You're pretty talkative today, too.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "What is this nostalgia?\r\nIt feels like remembering my childhood...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "I searched for her to no avail. Having no other choice, I stepped outside to find night had completely fallen.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...You're going to the shopping mall, aren't you?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...You're finally here. What took you so long?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "What's wrong? Hurry up.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Hey.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...And off she went.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...*sigh*\r\nGuess that's all for today.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "......",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "When we got separated, Trainer's face\r\nsearching for me naturally popped into my head.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...I'll deliver the items tomorrow.\r\nSee ya, Trainer.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "And then... I stopped in my tracks.\r\nI chose to wait.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...It turned out to be a day where I caught a glimpse of Narita Brian's clumsy kindness.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Whoa, it's Narita Brian! \r\nI've seen your races! Hey, can I get a picture?",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "In order to get to know Narita Brian better,\r\nI always try to talk to her as much as possible, but...",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "...Oh, it's you.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "We arrived at the shopping mall...\r\nEven from afar, our destination was visibly packed with people.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "Then one day, as I was walking toward\r\nthe shopping mall to do some errands—",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    },
    {
      "name": null,
      "text": "We finished our shopping, but—\r\nbefore I knew it, I had lost sight of Narita Brian.",
      "choice_data_list": [],
      "color_text_info_list": [],
      "new_clip_length": null
    }
  ],
  "no_wrap": true
}